{%- comment -%}
  Winter scene for sections/seasonal-collection: night sky, moon, snowy hills,
  pines, a snowman in a lime scarf and forest beanie, and the penguin. The
  falling snow lives on the section panel so it covers the whole section.
  Decorative only. Params: badge, caption, show_badge, mascot.
  part: 'icon' → only the small snowflake glyph used in the eyebrow.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if part == 'icon' -%}
<svg class="seasonal__glyph" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 2.5V21.5M20.2 7.3L3.8 16.8M20.2 16.8L3.8 7.3M14.6 5.1L12 7.6L9.4 5.1M19.3 10.8L15.8 9.8L16.7 6.3M16.7 17.7L15.8 14.2L19.3 13.2M9.4 18.9L12 16.4L14.6 18.9M4.7 13.2L8.2 14.2L7.3 17.7M7.3 6.3L8.2 9.8L4.7 10.8"/></svg>
{%- else -%}
<span class="sa__stars"></span><span class="sa__stars sa__stars--b"></span>
<span class="sa__moon"></span>
<svg class="sa__hill sa__hill--back" viewBox="0 0 400 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" focusable="false"><path d="M0 36C70 12 150 28 230 18S360 10 400 24V100H0Z" fill="#cfe5ec"/><path d="M0 36C70 12 150 28 230 18S360 10 400 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-opacity=".7" stroke-width="2.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"/></svg>
